        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>儿歌绕口令</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    background:#ffffff;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    position:relative;\n    width:540px;\n    min-height:729px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    border:6px solid #3d8ef5;\n    border-radius:4px;\n    padding:26px 22px 40px 22px;\n    background:#fff;\n  }\n  .sun{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:6px;\n    left:36px;\n    width:44px;\n    height:30px;\n  }\n  .cup{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:24px;\n    bottom:18px;\n    width:44px;\n    height:56px;\n  }\n  .columns{\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:flex-start;\n  }\n  .col{\n    width:50%;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .col.left{padding-right:6px;}\n  .col.right{padding-left:8px;}\n  h2.title{\n    color:#1a7fe0;\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin:0 0 14px 0;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n  }\n  .verse{\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.72;\n    color:#111;\n    margin:0;\n  }\n  .block2{\n    margin-top:34px;\n  }\n  .indent-title{\n    padding-left:18px;\n  }\n  .indent-body{\n    padding-left:14px;\n  }\n  .indent-body2{\n    padding-left:20px;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    display:block;\n    color:#8aa;\n    font-size:10px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder sun\">[图标：太阳，左上角]</div>\n\n  <!-- 第一组 -->\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col left\">\n      <h2 class=\"title\">《猫吃桃》</h2>\n      <p class=\"verse\">\n        河边有座窑，<br>\n        窑上有个槽，<br>\n        槽里放件袍，<br>\n        袍包个桃。<br>\n        对岸有只猫，<br>\n        想吃窑上槽里袍包桃，<br>\n        可惜岸上没有桥。<br>\n        过不了河，<br>\n        上不了窑，<br>\n        够不着槽，<br>\n        咬不住袍，<br>\n        吃不了桃。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col right\">\n      <h2 class=\"title indent-title\">《数青蛙》</h2>\n      <p class=\"verse indent-body2\">\n        一只青蛙一张嘴，<br>\n        两只眼睛四条腿，<br>\n        扑通一声跳下水。<br>\n        两只青蛙两张嘴，<br>\n        四只眼睛八条腿，<br>\n        扑通扑通两声跳下水。<br>\n        三只青蛙三张嘴，<br>\n        六只眼睛十二条腿，<br>\n        扑通扑通扑通三声跳下水。<br>\n        四只青蛙四张嘴，<br>\n        八只眼睛十六条腿，<br>\n        扑通扑通扑通扑通四声跳下水。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 第二组 -->\n  <div class=\"columns block2\">\n    <div class=\"col left\">\n      <h2 class=\"title indent-title\">《姥姥有个宝宝》</h2>\n      <p class=\"verse indent-body\">\n        姥姥有个宝宝，<br>\n        宝宝有位姥姥，<br>\n        姥姥疼爱宝宝，<br>\n        宝宝喜爱姥姥。<br>\n        姥姥天天抱宝宝，<br>\n        宝宝天天亲姥姥，<br>\n        姥姥老，走不好，<br>\n        抱着宝宝摔一胶，<br>\n        跌了姥姥，摔了宝宝，<br>\n        宝宝连忙扶姥姥，<br>\n        姥姥赶快抱宝宝。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col right\">\n      <h2 class=\"title\">《南南有个篮》</h2>\n      <p class=\"verse\">\n        南南有个篮篮，<br>\n        篮篮装着盘盘，<br>\n        盘盘放着碗碗，<br>\n        碗碗盛着饭饭。<br>\n        南南翻了篮篮，<br>\n        篮篮扣了盘盘，<br>\n        盘盘打了碗碗，<br>\n        碗碗撒了饭饭。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder cup\">[插图：饮料杯，右下角]</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
